      "source_file": "sample_questions.md",
      "question_text": "已知函数 $f(x) = x^3 - 3x$，求函数的极值。",
      "latex": [
        "f(x) = x^3 - 3x",
        "f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3",
        "f'(x) = 0",
        "x = \\pm 1",
        "x < -1",
        "f'(x) > 0",
        "-1 < x < 1",
        "f'(x) < 0",
        "x = -1",
        "f(-1) = 2",
        "x = 1",
        "f(1) = -2"
      ],
      "options": [],
      "standard_answer": "求导得 $f'(x) = 3x^2 - 3$，令 $f'(x) = 0$ 得 $x = \\pm 1$。当 $x < -1$ 时 $f'(x) > 0$，当 $-1 < x < 1$ 时 $f'(x) < 0$，故 $x = -1$ 处取得极大值 $f(-1) = 2$；同理 $x = 1$ 处取得极小值 $f(1) = -2$。",
